WEBVTT

00:04:28.963 --> 00:04:31.830
that keep track, via consensus,

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.130
of all content origination
and transactions.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.597
At the Blockchain Lab
at Georgia State University,

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.163
we study how to monetize creative labor

00:04:40.163 --> 00:04:43.897
using blockchains and other
decentralized ledger technologies.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.297
I believe that this technology
in the form of NFTs

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:50.163
has the potential to humanize the internet

00:04:50.197 --> 00:04:55.163
and to create an equitable foundation
for its next phase: the metaverse.

00:04:55.163 --> 00:05:00.463
This decentralized business model
gives financial power back to the creators